        "y1": 299.7161
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "The Chemical Brothers have slowly morphed from an incredibly visceral, heavy band into something altogether more melodic, but still psychedelic and vital. 这段中英混排的正文用于检验抽取器在换行拼接时是否正确处理中西文边界：中文不加空格，英文保词间空格。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.799Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b004",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 311.04560000000004,
        "x1": 425.1968522770001,
        "y1": 396.78858
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "一九八九年，曼彻斯特。两个学生在一场演出后台第一次交谈，话题是唱片的 B 面比 A 面更好听。这一句话后来被引用了无数次，因为它是整段历史的起点。他们相约下周带自己的样本带再见面，而那个约事实上再也没有被取消过。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.799Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b005",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 408.11808,
        "x1": 425.19685541649994,
        "y1": 475.70658000000003
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "日常的排练在宿舍进行，设备是一台破旧的采样机与两台唱机。他们把电视节目、电影对白与旧放克唱片剪成碎片，拼成每晚八分钟的开场。观众从十几人涨到几百人，场地从宿舍换到仓库。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.799Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b006",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 210.07874,
        "y0": 500.1365700000001,
        "x1": 350.07874000000004,
        "y1": 525.1365700000001
      },
      "type": "structure",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "我们从哪里开始",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.799Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b007",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 572.8161,
        "x1": 425.196858075,
        "y1": 640.4046
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "时间拨回更早。Tom Rowlands 出生于伦敦以南，却在伦敦以北的城市长大；Ed Simons 则相反。两人在各自学校的录音室里学会了同一件事：磁带机的暂停键就是最早的鼓机。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.799Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b008",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 651.73407,
        "x1": 425.19685045000006,
        "y1": 683.01355
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "石玫瑰的鼓点、acid house 的嘶嘶声、还有独立舞池里那种特有的汗味，构成了他们的底色。多年后回忆起",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.799Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b009",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 691.75944,
        "x1": 425.19683483062505,
        "y1": 717.00822
      },
      "type": "annotation",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "采样机型号已不可考，友人回忆说它“经常过热，需要冰袋降温”。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.799Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p01-b010",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": {
