    {
      "id": "p02-b002",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 125.23860000000005,
        "x1": 425.19684919,
        "y1": 156.51810000000003
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "来，他们说那不是一个流派，而是一种“什么都可以拼进来”的许可。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b003",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 191.07874,
        "y0": 167.84760000000009,
        "x1": 381.88474,
        "y1": 180.97260000000009
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "“我们从来不觉得 DJ 与乐队是对立的。”",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b004",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 191.07874,
        "y0": 192.30207,
        "x1": 348.57874000000004,
        "y1": 205.42707
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "——摘自某次电台访谈，年份不详",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b005",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 216.75660000000008,
        "x1": 425.19685541649994,
        "y1": 266.19056
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "第一场正式演出前的下午，他们在租来的排练房里把整套 set 从头到尾走了一遍，然后在楼下的炸鱼薯条店对账：门票收入减去场地费，每人分到十一英镑。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b006",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 210.07874,
        "y0": 290.6206000000001,
        "x1": 350.07874000000004,
        "y1": 315.6206000000001
      },
      "type": "structure",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "放下把铲子的人",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b007",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 363.30008000000004,
        "x1": 425.19685045000006,
        "y1": 430.8886
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "荣誉来得比预期早。单曲爬上榜单的那个星期，他们正在欧洲大陆一辆夜行大巴上，没人来得及庆祝。经纪人隔着两排座位喊过来一个数字，所有人安静了几秒，然后继续睡。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b008",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 164.82874,
        "y0": 442.21808,
        "x1": 430.44684,
        "y1": 491.65207000000004
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "评论界给他们贴了很多标签，他们只认其中一个：把仓库的声音搬进客厅。至于其余的形容词，用 Ed 的话说， “是报纸的事，不是唱片的事”。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b009",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 502.98157000000003,
        "x1": 425.19685045000006,
        "y1": 570.57007
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "巡演的尾声在东京。安可结束后全场灯亮，没有一个人离开。他们只好回到台上，用设备里剩的样本即兴了二十分钟。后来这段即兴从未发行，但在场者的转述让它变成了传说。",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b010",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 210.07874,
        "y0": 595.00009,
        "x1": 350.07874000000004,
        "y1": 620.00009
      },
      "type": "structure",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "出发去海滩之前",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p02-b011",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 170.07874,
        "y0": 667.67957,
        "x1": 425.19685045000006,
        "y1": 698.95911
      },
      "type": "flow",
      "state": "typed",
      "text": "第三张唱片排到一半，录音棚的房东换了锁。他们把设备搬进一栋废弃的银行金库，混音台就架在原来存放",
      "bold": false,
      "findings": [],
      "history": [
        {
          "ts": "2026-10-06T15:29:19.800Z",
          "action": "typed",
          "by": "machine:extract"
        }
      ]
    },
